  "label": "False Dichotomy",
  "description": "The meme uses a false dichotomy by presenting only two extreme options for women's behavior during economic collapse: either being self-reliant and prepared or engaging in transactional relationships. This oversimplification ignores the complexity of human behavior and societal responses to crisis, reinforcing the stereotype that women are incapable of nuanced or balanced responses.",
